@title EPISODE 30 • OFFICIAL
@bg meet_venue_indoor
Indoor Conference Championships. London is on crutches in the stands with a clipboard and a whistle Coach Holloway definitely didn't give her.
@show priya
Priya runs the 5K. London screams splits at her from the rail every lap.
London: SEVENTY-FOUR. You're SLOW. Go NOW, Priya!
Priya wins by half a second. She runs straight to the rail and hugs London over it.
Priya: You were SO mean. I loved it.
@add Priya_Friendship 3
@show diggy
Then the men's 400. Diggy in lane four. Coach M is pacing so hard he's going to wear a hole in the floor.
Diggy wins in 46.71. A new school record. Coach M picks him up. Then Shane picks up Coach M.
Diggy breaks free of all of them and limps — he's sore, it's 400 sore — up the stands to London.
@if Diggy_Trust 12 official
Diggy: So. That date went okay, right?
London: It was adequate.
Diggy: Adequate enough to make it official?
> [Sweet] "Yes. Obviously yes, you idiot." -> o1
> [Bitchy] "...Fine. But I'm telling Cassie myself." -> o1
> [Good] "Not yet. But soon. I promise." -> o2
