@show cassie
Cassie: (standing on a bench) ATTENTION EVERYONE. LONDON STERLING AND DIGGY WILLIAMS ARE OFFICIALLY DATING. I HAVE BEEN RIGHT SINCE SEPTEMBER.
The whole MVU section cheers. Holloway shakes her head and smiles at her clipboard.
@show paris
Paris: (hugging her) Mom's going to cry. Dad's going to cry harder.
