@bg parking_lot_night
After the meet. London waits by the bus while Diggy talks to a man in a navy Eastbrook jacket. The man hands him a folder.
@show diggy
Diggy: (walking back, quiet) That was Eastbrook's head coach.
London: What did he want?
Diggy: Full scholarship. Room, board, everything. For my mama too — they'd help with her bills. Starting next fall.
London: ...At Eastbrook.
Diggy: At Eastbrook.
End of Episode 30. To be continued...
